{'symbol': 'HON', 'date': '2021-06-22 11:20:00', 'title': 'HONEYWELL CYBERSECURITY RESEARCH REPORTS SIGNIFICANT INCREASE IN USB THREATS THAT CAN CAUSE COSTLY BUSINESS DISRUPTIONS', 'text': 'ATLANTA, JUNE 22, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ACCORDING TO A REPORT RELEASED TODAY BY HONEYWELL (NASDAQ: HON), USB-BASED THREATS THAT CAN SEVERELY IMPACT BUSINESS OPERATIONS INCREASED SIGNIFICANTLY DURING A DISRUPTIVE YEAR WHEN THE USAGE OF REMOVABLE MEDIA AND NETWORK CONNECTIVITY ALSO GREW. DATA FROM THE 2021 HONEYWELL INDUSTRIAL USB THREAT REPORT INDICATES THAT 37% OF THREATS WERE SPECIFICALLY DESIGNED TO UTILIZE REMOVABLE MEDIA, WHICH ALMOST DOUBLED FROM 19% IN THE 2020 REPORT.'}{'symbol': 'HON', 'date': '2021-06-22 11:20:00', 'title': 'HONEYWELL CYBERSECURITY RESEARCH REPORTS SIGNIFICANT INCREASE IN USB THREATS THAT CAN CAUSE COSTLY BUSINESS DISRUPTIONS', 'text': 'ATLANTA, JUNE 22, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ACCORDING TO A REPORT RELEASED TODAY BY HONEYWELL (NASDAQ: HON), USB-BASED THREATS THAT CAN SEVERELY IMPACT BUSINESS OPERATIONS INCREASED SIGNIFICANTLY DURING A DISRUPTIVE YEAR WHEN THE USAGE OF REMOVABLE MEDIA AND NETWORK CONNECTIVITY ALSO GREW. DATA FROM THE 2021 HONEYWELL INDUSTRIAL USB THREAT REPORT INDICATES THAT 37% OF THREATS WERE SPECIFICALLY DESIGNED TO UTILIZE REMOVABLE MEDIA, WHICH ALMOST DOUBLED FROM 19% IN THE 2020 REPORT.'}{'symbol': 'HON', 'date': '2021-06-22 11:20:00', 'title': 'HONEYWELL CYBERSECURITY RESEARCH REPORTS SIGNIFICANT INCREASE IN USB THREATS THAT CAN CAUSE COSTLY BUSINESS DISRUPTIONS', 'text': 'ATLANTA, JUNE 22, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ACCORDING TO A REPORT RELEASED TODAY BY HONEYWELL (NASDAQ: HON), USB-BASED THREATS THAT CAN SEVERELY IMPACT BUSINESS OPERATIONS INCREASED SIGNIFICANTLY DURING A DISRUPTIVE YEAR WHEN THE USAGE OF REMOVABLE MEDIA AND NETWORK CONNECTIVITY ALSO GREW. DATA FROM THE 2021 HONEYWELL INDUSTRIAL USB THREAT REPORT INDICATES THAT 37% OF THREATS WERE SPECIFICALLY DESIGNED TO UTILIZE REMOVABLE MEDIA, WHICH ALMOST DOUBLED FROM 19% IN